Network-free. Builds bundles and installs as node-install-layout does (its _bundle) and drives cs with cs-cli's
shims. The client-web build's commands are replaced by stand-ins (composer and npm need the network): they copy the
checkout's built vendor/ and public/build/ when present, else write placeholders, so serving SKIPs. Temp dirs only;
never the real launchd, ~/.local/bin or ~/Library/LaunchAgents (asserted); HOME is always fake.
"""
